OL,3,GNEWSAChanges to bus timetable set to
OL,4,Acome into effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new bus timetable is due to be
OL,7,Fintroduced with the aim of making
OL,8,Fservices more reliable and improving
OL,9,Fconnections to key destinations.
OL,11,FThe changes beginning 7 September in
OL,12,FGuernsey include more frequent buses,
OL,13,Flater evening services, a revised night
OL,14,Fnetwork, and the withdrawal of some
OL,15,Fservices, said the Committee for the
OL,16,FEnvironment and Infrastructure.
OL,18,FRoutes 51 and 52 were redesigned to
OL,19,Fcreate an hourly town circular service,
OL,20,Fwhile links to the Princess Elizabeth
OL,21,FHospital have also been improved, said
OL,22,Fthe committee.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
