OL,3,GNEWSAChanges to bus timetable set to
OL,4,Acome into effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Adrian Gabriel, president of the
OL,7,Fcommittee, said the changes would give
OL,8,Fpassengers "greater confidence that
OL,9,Fthey can depend on public transport".
